OL,3,GNEWSASeaside town's 10,000-seat arena
OL,4,Aplan uncertain
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn a former seafront lido
OL,7,Finto a 10,000-seat arena could change
OL,8,Fafter the local council began
OL,9,Fconsidering a more affordable future
OL,10,Ffor the venue.
OL,12,FNorth Somerset Council has been
OL,13,Fdeciding what to do with the derelict
OL,14,FTropicana building in
OL,15,FWeston-super-Mare, Somerset. Since May,
OL,16,Fit has been working on a proposal to
OL,17,Fturn the venue into an arena, with a
OL,18,F25-year lease deal with Live Nation.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
