OL,3,GNEWSASeaside town's 10,000-seat arena
OL,4,Aplan uncertain
OL,5,
OL,6,FOriginal plans to make a 10,000-seat
OL,7,Fvenue would cost the council an
OL,8,Fadditional #6.6m, and it is now
OL,9,Fproposing a space half the size.
OL,11,FCouncillor Mike Bell said the new offer
OL,12,Fwas based on "practicality and
OL,13,Fdeliverability", while also recognising
OL,14,Fthe impact of the venue on the
OL,15,Fsurrounding area.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
